InnoBERT is independently developed from the FinBERT pretrained model associated with:

Huang, Allen H., Hui Wang, and Yi Yang. "FinBERT: A Large Language Model for
Extracting Information from Financial Text." Contemporary Accounting Research
40, no. 2 (2023): 806-841.

Upstream project: https://github.com/yya518/FinBERT
Upstream checkpoint: https://huggingface.co/yiyanghkust/finbert-pretrain

InnoBERT is not affiliated with or endorsed by the original FinBERT or BERT developers.
The InnoBERT files differ from the upstream model through downstream fine-tuning,
an eight-label innovation taxonomy, threshold rules, and inference preprocessing.
